### star-code-architect/SKILL.md
--- 1
Dispatch read-only `subagent` subagents (`subagent_type: Explore`, `model:` the READ tier value read from `.env`, omitted when that key is empty), one per topic — structure & dependencies, config system, data pipeline, train/eval entrypoints, scripts & tools, tests & docs — run in parallel, each returning the structured report in `references/survey_spec.md`. The main agent merges them into the **repo map**: module inventory, dependency direction, ranked suspicious patterns (only those that would motivate a migration item).
